      "texts": {
        "en": "After a few contortions, we find a way to discreetly enter in the premises located under the attic, but we are soon stopped by a man: “Hey, guys, what do you think you’re doing?”\n\n“We’re investigating…”\n\n“You see, after what happened last night, I’m not in a talkative mood… John, tell the night watchman that we found the passage the other snoopers took to get in. And you, out!”\n\nYou no longer can access the top floor during this investigation."
      },
